<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Dec 14 totalled 134.067 million, versus a revised 134.695 million in the previous week and 135.231 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 169.563 million, versus a revised 167.977 million the previous week and 167.236 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
